WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.610
- So the office will start
streaming on Peacock in January.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:04.443
That's amazing.

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:05.880
So looking back on it,

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.100
do you have a favorite episode
or moment from the show?

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.480
'Cause I've asked this actually
a couple cast members of

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.240
yours and they have different ones.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.763
- I have so many, I
think when Michael Scott,

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.250
played by the great Steve Carell.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.880
is laying down on that table and,

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.696
and they're ripping the chest hair.

00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:27.011
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:28.833
- That's not, that's the wrong one.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.662
- That's not the office?

00:00:31.662 --> 00:00:32.495
- Nope, nope.

00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:34.400
- That's the same, that's
the guy from the office.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.233
It's the guy from the office.

00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:37.120
(Kelly laughing)
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.960
No, there's too many
great scenes to mention.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.550
I mean, there's too many.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:43.383
There's too much.

00:00:43.383 --> 00:00:46.440
But Dwight's beet form
as a bed and breakfast

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.110
was probably right up there for me.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:51.950
- I'm gonna say, your
comedic timing is hysterical.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.390
I think that dry humor is just so funny.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.860
And y'all's chemistry
as a cast is amazing.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.760
That's rare to find that.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.920
So do people still send
you Dwight Schrute gifts?

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.100
Do they still do that?

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:04.933
- Oh yeah.

00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:08.230
I get Dwight Schrute gifts all the time.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:10.600
In fact I have, a lot
of this art back here-

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:11.713
- I like that bear.

00:01:11.713 --> 00:01:15.330
- Hand drawn fan art, you know,

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.380
that people have given me.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.250
But the best piece of
Dwight art I ever got,

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.750
and I don't know why I
never took a picture of it.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:26.750
Someone took a beet and carved
Dwight's face in the beet

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.780
and it was so beautiful.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:30.620
They had probably spent
like 37 hours doing it.

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.800
It was an incredible work of art

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.080
and I took it home and I put
it in the bottom of a bag,

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:38.910
and of course it was moldy and
rotted by the time I got home

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.800
and it was, it was like one of
those beautiful works of art

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.920
that just came and went.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.100
It was like a snowflake.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.347
- You had to enjoy it in the moment.

00:01:45.347 --> 00:01:46.180
- Yeah.

